#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/HelpFiles/InstructorPGProblemEditor.html.ep:174
msgid ""
"You can also click \"Edit Selected Theme\" to edit a hardcopy theme.  The "
"new theme will be saved to the templates/hardcopyThemes folder."
msgstr "Můžete také kliknout na \"Upravit vybraný motiv\", chcete-li upravit motiv tištěné verze. Nový motiv bude uložen do složky templates/hardcopyThemes."

#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/templates/ContentGenerator/Hardcopy.html.ep:34
